summary:
The `mvn clean verify` command completed successfully, and the subsequent repository scan shows no remaining CRITICAL or HIGH severity vulnerabilities. All 19 baseline findings within the configured severity scope have been resolved. The remediation involved updating `org.apache.commons:commons-text` and `org.json:json` to their fixed versions, and explicitly setting the `org.apache.tomcat.embed:tomcat-embed-core` version to `11.0.25` in the `dependencyManagement` section. The `spring-boot-starter-parent` was updated from `4.0.6` to `4.0.7`, adhering to the patch version upgrade policy. No new suppression files were introduced.

All requirements have been met.

